sequenceDiagram
  %% Target design: fleet maintenance redesign 2026-11-03 (one Tools phase shared with node:converge; recipe packages held; 24 h / CVE version rule). docs/reference/tools.md#install-a-tool.
  %% status: draft
  %% command: tool:install
  %% kind: tool.install
  autonumber
  %% lane CLI icon=terminal pill=caller tone=gray
  %% lane GW icon=gateway pill=intent tone=blue
  %% lane SW icon=workflow pill=executes tone=green
  %% lane N icon=server pill=target tone=amber
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP<br/>orbit · MCP tools
  participant GW as Gateway<br/>Laravel API
  participant SW as Swamp<br/>serve on Node 209
  participant N as Node 12<br/>reached over ssh
  CLI->>GW: tool:install ripgrep<br/>--node=12 --manager=apt
  %%> Command:
  %%> - `orbit tool:install ripgrep --node=12 --manager=apt`
  %%> - syntax: `[package] --node=ID [--manager=MANAGER] [--constraint=CONSTRAINT] [--repository=JSON] [--idempotency-key=KEY] [--json]`
  Note over GW: Validate, record the Tool<br/>Tool: installing · task #5133
  %%> Requirements:
  %%> - your Node has an access grant to Node 12; the manager runs on its platform
  %%> - the package is not a recipe package of Node 12's roles
  GW->>SW: Start run, full intent<br/>operation-tool-write
  GW-->>CLI: 202 Accepted<br/>task #5133
  SW->>SW: Write the playbook input<br/>inventory · vars · known_hosts
  opt --repository
    SW->>SW: Verify the signing key<br/>fetch · fingerprint on 209
    %%> Why on 209:
    %%> - a wrong key stops the run before Node 12 is touched
  end
  SW->>N: Install Tools<br/>ansible · tags tools
  %%> Why the converge phase:
  %%> - one way to install a Tool, shared with `node:converge` and the rollout
  %%> - limited to this Tool, so other Tools do not move
  %%> Version:
  %%> - the newest in the constraint that is at least 24 hours old, or fixes a known CVE
  SW->>N: Check the Tool<br/>ansible · tags check
  alt check passes
    SW-->>GW: Run succeeded
    Note over GW: Record the version<br/>Tool: installed 14.1.0
  else the install fails
    SW--xGW: Run failed<br/>error_code
    %%> On failure:
    %%> - a Tool that needs another version of a held recipe package fails with `tool.recipe_conflict`; role software stays as tested
    Note over GW: Mark the Tool failed
  end
  loop every 2 s until terminal
    CLI->>GW: operation:show #5133
    GW-->>CLI: status + result
  end
